    { q:'What is <b>beamforming</b> for?',
      opts:['the AP aims energy straight at the client (a flashlight, not a candle) – stronger signal where it is','it permanently and irreversibly raises the AP’s max transmit power above the country’s legal limit','it encrypts the traffic a second time on top of WPA3, so eavesdropping is impossible even with the password'],
      correct:0, why:'Beamforming shapes the signal toward the client instead of all around – improving range and speed at the edge. MU-MIMO additionally serves several clients at once.' }
